# .ci-ephemeral-blocklist — RamShared
#
# Glob patterns for files that MUST NOT persist in the production tree.
# The CI gate (tools/ci/check-ephemeral-blocklist.mjs) scans all tracked
# files and blocks merge if any match. One pattern per line; lines starting
# with '#' are comments.
#
# Add patterns here BEFORE creating ephemeral utilities, so CI catches
# them if they are accidentally committed.

# Upstream dispatch / submission helpers (one-shot scripts, not production)
scripts/upstream/*.sh
**/submit-*.sh
**/dispatch-*.sh

# Ad-hoc / scratch utilities that should never be shipped
scripts/ad-hoc/**
scripts/scratch/**
